# Keep secrets and runtime state OUT of the image.
#
# The Dockerfile ends with `COPY . .`, so without this file anything sitting in
# a developer's working tree is baked into an image layer — including
# sessions/*.json, which holds live StepStone recruiter auth cookies
# (PHRECRUITERAUTHCOOKIE, RSTOKEN, authHash, X-AUTH-CSRF-TOKEN). Those are
# gitignored, so they never reach the repo, but `docker build` does not read
# .gitignore. Anyone who builds locally and pushes the image ships them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
sessions/
state/
screenshots/
stepstone_cookies.json

# Not secret, just dead weight in a multi-GB Playwright image.
.git
.gitignore
.github/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.vscode/
docs/
tests/
*.png
